# Copy to .env.local for local runs. Do not commit real values.
#
# Cloud agents: use the Cursor Secrets tab only. Never put secrets in the repo.
# These keys already exist in Cursor Secrets for this environment:
#   DEEPSEEK_API_KEY
#   FIRECRAWLER_API_KEY
#
# Phase 0 demo-shell does not read these yet. Listed so later slices know the names.

# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# FIRECRAWLER_API_KEY=

# DualAB-A shared-server mutate gate (POST /api/ameisen/params|step|tools).
# Unset / empty → fail closed (403). When set, send: Authorization: Bearer <value>
# Production: leave unset unless unlocking DualAB-A writes in Vercel env (see docs/DEPLOY.md).
# AMEISEN_MUTATE_SECRET=
